    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that it's a balance, but if you had to prioritize one to ensure actual stability, which way would you lean? like, if we don't have secure borders, can the humanitarian side even work? or if we just focus on enforcement, aren't we just ignoring the actual economic reality of needing labor?",
